<title>UK: All the key numbers - UK CBI distributive trades.</title>
<headline>All the key numbers - UK CBI distributive trades.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following is a table of results from the Confederation of British Industry August quarterly distributive trades survey.</p>
<p>Percentage balances (difference between number replying positively and number replying negatively to key questions.)</p>
<p>1996----------------------------------1995-------------------</p>
<p>VOLUME OF ANNUAL SALES REPORTED</p>
<p>Aug  July June  May  April  Mar  Feb  Jan  Dec  Nov  Oct  Sep</p>
<p> +53  +43  +45   +29   +32   +27  +30  +31  +31  +23  +16   0</p>
<p>VOLUME OF ANNUAL SALES -- THREE MONTHLY MOVING AVERAGE  </p>
<p> +47  +39  +35   +29   +30   +29  +31  +28  +23  +13   +3  +1</p>
<p>VOLUME OF ORDERS PLACED ON SUPPLIERS</p>
<p> +35  +38  +29   +24   +21   +21  +10   +6  +12  +15   +7  -2</p>
<p>VOLUME OF SALES FOR TIME OF YEAR</p>
<p> +20  +18  +26    +5    +8    +8    0   +3  +10   -6  -14 -14</p>
<p>VOLUME OF STOCKS RELATIVE TO EXPECTED DEMAND</p>
<p>  +9  +14  +13   +21   +19   +17  +22  +18  +19  +15  +23 +15</p>
<p>1996----------------------------------1995-------------------</p>
<p>VOLUME OF ANNUAL SALES EXPECTED</p>
<p> Sep  Aug  July  June  May   Apr  Mar  Feb  Jan  Dec  Nov  Oct</p>
<p> +56  +50  +45   +45   +40   +42  +45  +34  +27  +28  +21  +24</p>
<p>VOLUME OF ANNUAL SALES EXPECTED--THREE MONTH MOVING AVERAGE</p>
<p> +50  +47   +43   +42   +42   +40 +35  +30  +25  +24  +20  +18</p>
<p>VOLUME OF ORDERS PLACED ON SUPPLIERS - EXPECTED</p>
<p> +41  +33   +28   +30   +20   +26  +26  +15   +6  +14   +4  +12</p>
<p>VOLUME OF SALES FOR TIME OF YEAR - EXPECTED</p>
<p> +26  +22   +27   +18   +16   +11  +13   +4   +3   +2   -7   -2</p>
<p>VOLUME OF STOCKS RELATIVE TO EXPECTED DEMAND - EXPECTED</p>
<p>  +8   +9   +12   +15    +9   +15  +13  +14   +6  +10  +15  +15</p>
